---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility Statement" description="The iBridge Education website accessibility statement." locale="en" zhPath="/accessibility/" enPath="/en/accessibility/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Website policy" title="Accessibility Statement" copy="iBridge Education aims to provide a clear, operable website that can be used by a wide range of visitors. Last updated: 29 July 2026." />
  <section class="section section-white"><article class="container legal">
    <h2>Measures included in this version</h2><p>The website uses semantic headings, keyboard-operable navigation, a skip link, visible focus styles, alternative text, responsive layouts and high-contrast colour combinations. Main body copy does not depend on an excessively thin font weight.</p>
    <h2>Text and colour</h2><p>General copy uses dark charcoal-blue text on cream or white backgrounds. Dark sections use white or light cream text. Colour is not the only means used to convey important information.</p>
    <h2>Ongoing improvement</h2><p>As the website and resource library expand, new pages, forms and downloads will be checked for keyboard access, heading structure, alternative text and text contrast.</p>
    <h2>Report a problem</h2><p>If content is difficult or impossible to use, email <a href="mailto:hello@ibridge.info">hello@ibridge.info</a> with the page address, device, browser and a description of the issue.</p>
  </article></section>
</BaseLayout>
